  "limitations": [
    "One group per configuration with four repetitions of the same task; descriptive results without inferential confidence intervals",
    "Fixed four-CPU affinity on a shared native host with an eight-CPU cgroup quota; not an isolated GitHub-hosted runner",
    "Cold means fresh build trees and disabled compiler cache; host page cache was retained",
    "Twenty original test names were checked, but only format-test was compiled and executed; this is not a full F2P/P2P qualification",
    "Active task latency excludes queue waiting; queue plus active latency is reported separately",
    "Sampled resource peaks are lower bounds; shared host/cgroup/filesystem counters cannot be attributed exclusively to these builds",
    "Summed process-tree RSS can count shared pages multiple times and excludes reparented children and Docker daemon-owned containers",
    "Observer elapsed time is recorded, included in wall time, and is not equivalent to additive CPU overhead",
    "Each worker uses two build jobs; four workers therefore oversubscribe the four-CPU affinity",
    "Sequential configuration order and single task limit generalization; no model rate limits or Docker storage behavior were exercised",
    "This concurrency driver differs from the build-cache A/B driver; compare only the three groups within this report"
  ]
